   "claimed_not_yet_digested": "OpenAI repo released 2026-10-06 includes proofs for 23 Erdos problems (19 with Lean files), not yet checked by the site owner. The database lists 7 problems as 'open (Lean)': a formal proof exists but no human has digested it.",
